OL,3,GNEWSAM8 westbound reopens after bus
OL,4,Abursts into flames near Livingston
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M8 westbound has reopened after a
OL,7,Fbus burst into flames during rush hour.
OL,9,FThe busy motorway was closed between
OL,10,Fjunctions two and three after the fire
OL,11,Fwas reported at about 16:55.
OL,13,FTraffic Scotland said the road had now
OL,14,Freopened.
OL,16,FFootage showed large flames engulfing
OL,17,Fthe vehicle and there were reports of
OL,18,Flong queues stretching back to
OL,19,FHermiston Gait in Edinburgh.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
